diff --git a/lucene/CHANGES.txt b/lucene/CHANGES.txt
index 16a6728248cd..b51c48ae4b8a 100644
--- a/lucene/CHANGES.txt
+++ b/lucene/CHANGES.txt
@@ -359,6 +359,11 @@ Other
 API Changes
 ---------------------
 
+* GITHUB#16696: FlatVectorsWriter gains mergeOneFlatVectorFieldForMergeScorer and the
+  FlatVectorsWriter.MergeScorerData handle it returns, so that a flat writer can prepare what a
+  merge scorer over the merged vectors needs while it writes them. The default prepares nothing;
+  a writer that wraps another one should forward the new method too. (John Maurice)
+
 * GITHUB#14399: Add a default LeafFieldComparator#disableSkipping method so document skipping can be
   disabled per segment. (Serhiy Bzhezytskyy)
 
@@ -518,6 +523,10 @@ Optimizations
 
 * GITHUB#16520: Support two-phase filters in MaxScoreBulkScorer bitset path. (Ke Wei)
 
+* GITHUB#16696: Merging an HNSW graph over Lucene104HnswScalarQuantizedVectorsFormat in its default
+  CENTERED mode, with an asymmetric encoding of a float32 field, no longer reads the merged float
+  vectors back to build the merge scorer. (John Maurice)
+
 Bug Fixes
 ---------------------
 
